[{"title":"白发二首 其二","author":"龚诩","text":"镜里容颜奈老何，流光瞬息易蹉跎。\n却嫌白发无公道，偏使愁人分外多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49043,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨竹赠陈存诚 其一","author":"龚诩","text":"雨梢风叶夜飕飕，长忆溪堂下榻留。\n清气逼人眠不得，吟诗直过五更头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49044,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨竹赠陈存诚 其二","author":"龚诩","text":"一别知心几许时，每因风月寄相思。\n定知诗骨秋来瘦，应似霜馀翠竹枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49045,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留侯","author":"龚诩","text":"已闻赤帝收秦鹿，又见乌江刎楚猴。\n一点报韩心已遂，重轻宜不较封留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49046,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画竹石二首 其一","author":"龚诩","text":"忆移兰棹过茗溪，溪上天寒日欲西。\n歌罢竹枝风正急，乱云生处鹧鸪啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49047,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画竹石二首 其二","author":"龚诩","text":"霜清木落九秋天，十里寒江罩晚烟。\n记得故人舟泊处，钓竿生在石崖边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49048,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归娄江","author":"龚诩","text":"昔年曾住娄江上，看到园林几树春。\n今日归来风景异，梅花独识旧时人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49049,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀季友梅 其一","author":"龚诩","text":"知己堪怜会面难，久无鱼鸟问平安。\n遥知风雪虚斋里，人与梅花共岁寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49050,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀季友梅 其二","author":"龚诩","text":"举世唯知妇寺忠，荔枝兴叹只坡翁。\n羡君识鉴追前哲，敢不低头拜孟东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49051,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双竹图为陈止庵赋时余归玉峰是夕寓其馆","author":"龚诩","text":"难弟难兄一样清，襟怀同抱岁寒情。\n夜来醉倚南州榻，爱听风前佩玉声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49052,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园杂兴 其一","author":"龚诩","text":"十载飘零东复西，故园花木总成溪。\n归来但觉清贫好，有舌何曾肯示妻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49053,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园杂兴 其二","author":"龚诩","text":"风吹鹤发短萧萧，数首新诗酒一瓢。\n爱看前村风色好，不知行过竹西桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49054,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园杂兴 其三","author":"龚诩","text":"稚子囊书仆抱琴，梅花香里独清吟。\n人言恰是西湖景，只是先生不姓林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49055,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园杂兴 其四","author":"龚诩","text":"厚味何如淡味长，充庖不羡大官羊。\n老妻昨夜挑新菜，酿得黄齑满瓮香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49056,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园杂兴 其五","author":"龚诩","text":"草庵新结傍清溪，种得梅花与屋齐。\n结实未图调鼎鼐，岁寒聊取作诗题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49057,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园杂兴 其六","author":"龚诩","text":"布被棱棱似铁寒，一宵诗梦屡更端。\n觉来爱煞窗前月，送我梅花瘦影看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49058,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"龚诩","text":"不向东华踏软红，却来江上汎孤篷。\n水光山色知多少，都入先生笑咏中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49059,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺怨 其一","author":"龚诩","text":"枝头花落减春光，游子归期正渺茫。\n啼鸟数声惊梦断，一庭芳草又斜阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49060,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺怨 其二","author":"龚诩","text":"春来日日望郎归，转觉天涯信字稀。\n回首又惊三月暮，东风门巷柳花飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49061,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺怨 其三","author":"龚诩","text":"玉容花貌日摧颓，夫婿他乡未卜归。\n一点妾心何所似，精金百鍊不成灰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49062,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陶子巽惠扇以诗酬之","author":"龚诩","text":"昨荷缄书问起居，清风一箑意何如。\n报琼只有言相赠，灯火新凉好读书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49063,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏暑","author":"龚诩","text":"一寒一暑自循环，无伐天和付等閒。\n却笑世人因苦热，就凉争欲倚冰山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49064,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"龚诩","text":"每忆家山乐事多，小桥烟柳蘸晴波。\n只今已办归休计，问字谁当载酒过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49065,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋况","author":"龚诩","text":"岁晚天寒木叶稀，敝庐无恙尚堪依。\n如何苦恋鱼羹饭，孤负黄花待客归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49066,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日寄袁宗鲁","author":"龚诩","text":"此身憔悴如秋叶，每见凉风只欲飞。\n想得故人新酒熟，应培黄菊待侬归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49067,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏菊","author":"龚诩","text":"曾见陶公拂袖归，晚香佳色傲霜威。\n过时只抱枝头老，不学狂花到处飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49068,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林和靖观梅图","author":"龚诩","text":"颓然醉貌古衣冠，酷爱梅花冒雪看。\n疏影暗香吟已就，但知诗好不知寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49069,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春有感","author":"龚诩","text":"客边情绪苦多违，光景那堪过眼非。\n不觉此身忙里老，忍看春色雨中归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49070,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归庄图为俞景明赋","author":"龚诩","text":"青山绿树映波光，有客归来趁野航。\n柔橹数声歌一阕，知君应是和沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49071,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永思亭为宗善赋","author":"龚诩","text":"源发岷峨可滥觞，滔滔东注接扶桑。\n最怜之子思亲念，个样渊深个样长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49072,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周廷悦以画梅二幅求题将勉其义子马纲","author":"龚诩","text":"玉妃曾服丹霞酿，冰雪虽寒晕自红。\n不似陌头桃与杏，强誇颜色媚春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49073,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题周豫怡园 其一 柳堤莺韵","author":"龚诩","text":"摇曳春风绿万丝，笙簧朝暮语莺儿。\n谁知孝子伤心处，不见停杯侧耳时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49074,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题周豫怡园 其二 竹坞棋声","author":"龚诩","text":"对客围棋万玉中，子声剥啄度春风。\n仙翁久出巴山橘，遗迹难忘手泽工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49075,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题时苗留犊图","author":"龚诩","text":"去官留犊记当年，争道沽廉未足贤。\n自已不能嫌胜已，几人归去汎空船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49076,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈允德湄溪新咏 其一 柳塘春水","author":"龚诩","text":"湄溪新水碧如苔，溪上垂杨夹岸栽。\n诗酒画船来住惯，眼明鸥鹭不相猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49077,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈允德湄溪新咏 其二 绿荫黄鹂","author":"龚诩","text":"过雨溪山古木齐，亭台清閟绿阴迷。\n黄莺亦似怜佳境，飞去飞来不惜啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49078,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风浪渔舟图为族孙以行赋","author":"龚诩","text":"巨浪打翻高岸石，狂风吹折古松枝。\n渔郎要整丝纶钓，好待风恬浪息时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49079,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"记会稽周士翔先生遗语二绝句 其一","author":"龚诩","text":"不知天数为何物，忠孝唯求死即休。\